# Data retention (HANDOFF-COMPLIANCE.md §1) — leave unset. Unset means
# retention/minimisation does nothing (scripts/retention.py becomes a
# no-op). Only the DPO sets these; do not guess a value here.
# CERT_RETENTION_DAYS=
# AUDIT_RETENTION_DAYS=
# SESSION_RETENTION_DAYS=
